abstract: >-
  A public-data-only techno-economic model of food proteins made by precision fermentation,
  following Humbird's (2021) method: element- and electron-balanced stoichiometry, an
  oxygen-transfer-limited fed-batch fermenter, a downstream train and a capital estimate
  anchored to the market price of baker's yeast. Every parameter carries a source and an
  evidence grade. Code under MIT; data, text and figures under CC BY 4.0. Prepared with an
  AI assistant and audited by independent AI reviewers; not yet reviewed by a human expert.
  The views expressed are purely those of the author and may not in any circumstances be
  regarded as stating an official position of the European Commission.
